# Room 3 — live match vs Room 2 layouts

**Velocity:** live session velocity is **(last − first) / first**, same as Room 2 / precursor.

**Match:** `match_spatial` z-scores against the current same-TF library using **median + MAD** (not mean/std). Z is hard-clipped to **±5**. Dead (near-zero MAD) dims stay z=0. **No raw-vector fallback.** Score is **weighted cosine** (weighted dot / weighted L2) with static `FEATURE_MATCH_WEIGHTS` — velocity slots 0–2 and volume slots 3–4 lead; VWAP/Pearson sit back; SEC weight 0. Size still cuts when two strategies are almost equally close. **Same-TF only.**

**Handle on layouts:** each vault-sourced layout bucket gets `handle_execution` at hydrate. DNA vectors are not mutated. Supabase stays read-only.

**Related:** Job 1 Yahoo screener is parked (`BUILTIN_SCREENER_ENABLED = False`).
